{
    "title": "Fandango - Buy Movie Tickets",
    "description": "Fandango is your #1 movie app to skip the line and watch new movies as soon as they hit theaters. Find showtimes and movie tickets at a cinema near you when you reserve in app. Browse new movies and buy tickets as soon as they release on the movie app with over 2 million 5-Star Reviews. Seamlessly plan your next movie night with the easiest way to hit the theaters \u2013 Fandango.\r\n\r\nDiscover the newest movie trailers, Rotten Tomatoes\u00ae scores, showtimes, and available seating options at countless cinemas nationwide. Fandango brings the best of movie apps to your fingertips, letting you save your preferred movie theater, buy last minute tickets, and enjoy reserved seating \u2013 all in one. Watch films confidently with up to date Rotten Tomatoes\u00ae scores to see what others are saying before you buy your movie ticket. Find the latest movies, secure your tickets, and hit concessions with the help of Fandango.\r\n\r\nSecure your mobile ticket for the next theater release with Fandango. Download today to earn rewards, find new movies, and make the most of your cinema experience.\r\n\r\nFANDANGO APP FEATURES\r\n\r\nTHE BEST OF MOVIE APPS\r\n- Browse new movies, Rotten Tomatoes\u00ae scores, and get FanAlert notifications for movies you want to catch.\r\n- Watch movie trailers for upcoming films and buy movie tickets as soon as they release.\r\n- Search showtimes for the movies you want with the \u2018In Theaters Today\u2019 filter.\r\n- Watch movies with reserved seating for the best spots in the movie theater.\r\n\r\nBUY MOVIE TICKETS & MORE\r\n- Check available seats at your preferred cinema with Seat Map Preview\r\n- Watch films while avoiding the box office line with Fandango.\r\n- Access your favorite theater seamlessly with your mobile ticket.\r\n- Buy tickets and split payments with friends easily with PayPal or Venmo. No more IOUs.\r\n\r\nFREE FANDANGO ACCOUNT\r\n- Enjoy a movie app that\u2019s free, fast, and convenient.\r\n- Access all the best features you come to expect from movie apps. Save your favorite movies, preferred movie theater, payment info, and theater rewards account information.\r\n- Earn rewards on every movie ticket purchase.\r\n\r\nEARN REWARDS IN-APP & IN THEATERS\r\n- Earn rewards every time you visit cinemas with both Fandango FanRewards Points and movie theater points.\r\n- For every 4 tickets, get a $5 reward toward Fandango movie tickets or Vudu on demand streaming.\r\n- Earn rewards with your favorite cinema reward programs like AMC Stubs, Regal Crown Club, Cinemark Movie Rewards, and more!\r\n\r\nHASSLE FREE CINEMA APP\r\n- Buy tickets confidently with online refunds and exchanges.\r\n- Easily refund or exchange your movie tickets before the theater deadline.\r\n- Manage any mobile ticket issue easily with self-service refunds.\r\n\r\nDownload Fandango today and enjoy new movies for a seamless cinema experience. See showtimes, buy tickets, reserve your seats, and earn rewards \u2013 all in one easy to use movie app.\r\n\r\nFandango\u2019s partners are the nation\u2019s leading exhibitors, including AMC Theatres, Regal Cinemas, Cinemark, Marcus Theatres, Harkins Theatres, and many other innovative theater chains and independent cinemas. Together, these exhibitors represent more than ninety percent of the nation's theaters with online ticketing capabilities.\r\n\r\nBy downloading, installing & using this App, you agree to Fandango's Privacy Policy (https://www.nbcuniversal.com/fandango-privacy-policy) and Terms and Policies (https://www.fandango.com/policies/terms-and-policies).\r\nAd Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/cookies#accordionheader2\r\nYour Privacy Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo\r\nCA Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act\r\n\r\nThanks for using our app! For customer support, please visit: https://www.fandango.com/help",
    "descriptionHTML": "Fandango is your #1 movie app to skip the line and watch new movies as soon as they hit theaters. Find showtimes and movie tickets at a cinema near you when you reserve in app. Browse new movies and buy tickets as soon as they release on the movie app with over 2 million 5-Star Reviews. Seamlessly plan your next movie night with the easiest way to hit the theaters \u2013 Fandango.<br><br>Discover the newest movie trailers, Rotten Tomatoes\u00ae scores, showtimes, and available seating options at countless cinemas nationwide. Fandango brings the best of movie apps to your fingertips, letting you save your preferred movie theater, buy last minute tickets, and enjoy reserved seating \u2013 all in one. Watch films confidently with up to date Rotten Tomatoes\u00ae scores to see what others are saying before you buy your movie ticket. Find the latest movies, secure your tickets, and hit concessions with the help of Fandango.<br><br>Secure your mobile ticket for the next theater release with Fandango. Download today to earn rewards, find new movies, and make the most of your cinema experience.<br><br>FANDANGO APP FEATURES<br><br>THE BEST OF MOVIE APPS<br>- Browse new movies, Rotten Tomatoes\u00ae scores, and get FanAlert notifications for movies you want to catch.<br>- Watch movie trailers for upcoming films and buy movie tickets as soon as they release.<br>- Search showtimes for the movies you want with the \u2018In Theaters Today\u2019 filter.<br>- Watch movies with reserved seating for the best spots in the movie theater.<br><br>BUY MOVIE TICKETS &amp; MORE<br>- Check available seats at your preferred cinema with Seat Map Preview<br>- Watch films while avoiding the box office line with Fandango.<br>- Access your favorite theater seamlessly with your mobile ticket.<br>- Buy tickets and split payments with friends easily with PayPal or Venmo. No more IOUs.<br><br>FREE FANDANGO ACCOUNT<br>- Enjoy a movie app that\u2019s free, fast, and convenient.<br>- Access all the best features you come to expect from movie apps. Save your favorite movies, preferred movie theater, payment info, and theater rewards account information.<br>- Earn rewards on every movie ticket purchase.<br><br>EARN REWARDS IN-APP &amp; IN THEATERS<br>- Earn rewards every time you visit cinemas with both Fandango FanRewards Points and movie theater points.<br>- For every 4 tickets, get a $5 reward toward Fandango movie tickets or Vudu on demand streaming.<br>- Earn rewards with your favorite cinema reward programs like AMC Stubs, Regal Crown Club, Cinemark Movie Rewards, and more!<br><br>HASSLE FREE CINEMA APP<br>- Buy tickets confidently with online refunds and exchanges.<br>- Easily refund or exchange your movie tickets before the theater deadline.<br>- Manage any mobile ticket issue easily with self-service refunds.<br><br>Download Fandango today and enjoy new movies for a seamless cinema experience. See showtimes, buy tickets, reserve your seats, and earn rewards \u2013 all in one easy to use movie app.<br><br>Fandango\u2019s partners are the nation\u2019s leading exhibitors, including AMC Theatres, Regal Cinemas, Cinemark, Marcus Theatres, Harkins Theatres, and many other innovative theater chains and independent cinemas. Together, these exhibitors represent more than ninety percent of the nation&#39;s theaters with online ticketing capabilities.<br><br>By downloading, installing &amp; using this App, you agree to Fandango&#39;s Privacy Policy (https://www.nbcuniversal.com/fandango-privacy-policy) and Terms and Policies (https://www.fandango.com/policies/terms-and-policies).<br>Ad Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/cookies#accordionheader2<br>Your Privacy Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo<br>CA Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act<br><br>Thanks for using our app! For customer support, please visit: https://www.fandango.com/help",
